    <description>SFP-24652 W&amp;I: Request Management | Multiple Value Transfers - Screen flow invoked on case from the button to create Financial Account Transaction record (Value Transfer)
SFP-37991: 1| Hotfix | W&amp;I Value Transfer Approval Process and Flow - Validation for Debit account number removed and the validation for tasks only applicable to Call Client task for High risk value transfers.
SFP-38675: 2 | W&amp;I Value Transfer Enhancements | Approval Process, Apex Class, Flow - The client to be debited is changed to an Account lookup to allow the the VT capturer to select the account and allow multiple value transfers to be created in one case.
SFP-39330: Hotfix | W&amp;I CERA and CER Application, VT Issues - Limit the Beneficiary Name input to 30 Characters, and default the Client to be debited to the case Account Name.
SFP-39853:Hotfix | W&amp;I VT Email Task Issues - Updated the formula logic to check the Call Client Task completion, the logic was not including the task created when an email is sent from a case.
[SFP-44855] W&amp;I: Value Transfer| Service Fulfillments Relationships</description>
